+
+- [ ] **REC-045**: While a visit is unresolved, the record store SHALL associate it with exactly one open conflict and no usable current revision.
+- [ ] **REC-046**: If an unauthenticated caller attempts a record-store submission, retrieval, or resolution operation, then the record store SHALL reject the operation without changing persistent state.
